=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Shamarhaan} (F-9) in {z:Bastok Markets} - short run from HP#2.
* Head to {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}, and talk to {n:Iruki-Waraki} (K-9, top floor).
* Speak with {n:Ghatsad} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-7), inside of the Automaton Workshop.
** It's possible you will need to speak to him twice.
* Take the northern Port Ephramad ferry to {z:Nashmau} and go through North Gate to {z:Caedarva Mire}. Head NE/NW to the (I-6) zone to {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** Taking the survival guide to Arrapago Reef works as well.
* Find the **???** at (H-10) on the first boat, hidden beneath the stairs, to receive {@k} {k:Antique automaton}.
** **THIS IS NOT THE ??? THAT YOU CHECK FOR CORSAIR, IT IS ON THE SOUTHERN BOAT OF H-10**
** Note that a {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} is **not** needed to access the **???**.
* Speak to Ghatsad.
* Wait until the next Vana'diel day and speak to Ghatsad to receive your new {p:Automaton}.
* Speak with Iruki-Waraki (K-9, top floor) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate to complete the quest and receive your {p:Animator}. You will also be asked to choose a name for your Automaton from a list.
** You can choose from more names if you opt to {p:rename your Automaton|Automaton}.

